{
  "id": "safe-largest",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Güvenli En Büyük",
    "en": "A Safe Largest"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.rs",
  "solution": "solution.rs",
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`list.first()?` boş listede `None` ile döner.",
      "en": "`list.first()?` returns with `None` on an empty list."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```rust\nfn largest<T: PartialOrd>(list: &[T]) -> Option<&T> {\n    let mut top = list.first()?;\n    for item in list {\n        if item > top {\n            top = item;\n        }\n    }\n    Some(top)\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{:?}\", largest(&[3, 9, 2]));\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```rust\nfn largest<T: PartialOrd>(list: &[T]) -> Option<&T> {\n    let mut top = list.first()?;\n    for item in list {\n        if item > top {\n            top = item;\n        }\n    }\n    Some(top)\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{:?}\", largest(&[3, 9, 2]));\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "rust_test",
      "tests": [
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(largest(&[3, 9, 2]), Some(&9));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "sayı",
            "en": "numbers"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(largest(&['a', 'z']), Some(&'z'));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "harf",
            "en": "letters"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(largest::<i32>(&[]), None);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "boş",
            "en": "empty"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(largest(&[1.5, 0.5]), Some(&1.5));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "ondalık",
            "en": "decimals"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "let w = [String::from(\"a\"), String::from(\"b\")]; assert_eq!(largest(&w), Some(&String::from(\"b\")));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "String",
            "en": "String"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_forbid",
      "pattern": "\\.max\\(",
      "show": ".max("
    }
  ]
}
